    "body": "How about a \"standard\" JS API instead of a new element?\r\n\r\nSomething like: (```'L'``` here is the error correction level)\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<canvas onload=\"document.WebBarcodes.QRCode('my text', 'L')\">\r\n```",
